          <p>Figma (Variables, Auto-layout, Interactive Components), FigJam, Adobe XD, Photoshop, Illustrator.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services (3D Tilt Cards) -->
  <section id="services" class="services-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Specialized Services</h2>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card tilt-card">
          <h3>01. Mobile App Design</h3>
          <p>End-to-end user-centric interfaces with responsive touch states and frictionless flows.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card tilt-card">
          <h3>02. Dashboards & Admin Panels</h3>
          <p>Data visualization UI designed for clarity, high analytics productivity, and custom theme systems.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card tilt-card">
          <h3>03. High-Converting Hero Sections</h3>
          <p>Landing page visuals built to drive high user conversion and retention.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card tilt-card">
          <h3>04. UX Wireframing & Prototyping</h3>
          <p>Clickable, hyper-realistic prototype blueprints built in Figma.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card tilt-card">
          <h3>05. Digital Banners & Visuals</h3>
          <p>High-impact ad creatives and promotional graphics for multi-channel marketing campaigns.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
